# PokéPrices public-repo hygiene patterns (PCRE, one per line). Frozen. Never scanned by itself.
/hom[e]/[a-z_][a-z0-9_-]*
/run/user/[0-9]+
/Users/[A-Za-z]
~/(?:Repositories|Documents|snapshots|apps|bin)\b
\b10\.[0-9]{1,3}\.[0-9]{1,3}\.[0-9]{1,3}\b
\b192\.168\.[0-9]{1,3}\.[0-9]{1,3}\b
\b172\.(?:1[6-9]|2[0-9]|3[01])\.[0-9]{1,3}\.[0-9]{1,3}\b
\b100\.(?:6[4-9]|[7-9][0-9]|1[01][0-9]|12[0-7])\.[0-9]{1,3}\.[0-9]{1,3}\b
:808[2-6]\b
